                                                "sense_id": "1dfd8fc3-7753-31a7-b8ac-71b38bbcea87",
                                                "text": "\"I never saw such a gun in my life,\" replied poor Winkle, looking at the lock, as if that would do any good."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7800a967-1140-3e47-bb49-465d07b42131",
                                        "entry_id": "386e2d44-f4e3-3624-9282-73cef9c6ba29",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Complete control over a situation."
