                                                "sense_id": "c2125145-12b0-34e2-a3cb-a20d0ee4c1a9",
                                                "text": "Ashton only had to wait three minutes for his second try, lock Louis Deacon setting it up with a rollocking line-break, before Romania got on the scoreboard courtesy of a penalty from fly-half Marin Danut Dumbrava."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
